### ============================================================
### 10) ORDER INDEX FLOW (e2e test cho logic MAX+1 / SHIFT / CLAMP)
###    - Test các case quan trọng của orderIndex qua HTTP API
###    - Bổ sung cho OrderIndexResolverTest (unit test)
###
###  CÁC CASE ĐƯỢC COVER:
###    A) Auto max+1 khi tạo mà KHÔNG gửi orderIndex
###    B) Shift các record cũ khi tạo mới với orderIndex = 1 (chen đầu)
###    C) Move-up: cập nhật orderIndex từ cuối lên đầu (shift các lesson giữa)
###    D) Move-down: cập nhật orderIndex từ đầu xuống cuối (shift các lesson giữa)
###    E) Clamp khi set orderIndex vượt MAX
###    F) Section orderIndex tự gán max+1 khi tạo mới
###    G) Kanji item orderIndex tự gán max+1 khi tạo mới
###
###  PREREQUISITES:
###    1. Chạy 01-auth.http trước (có @teacherToken)
###    2. Có 1 course đã tạo (dùng @courseId hoặc chạy 02-course-crud.http trước)
### ============================================================

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@teacherToken = {{teacherLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}
@courseId = {{createCourseN5.response.body.data.id}}

####################################################################
## SETUP: Tạo course mới sạch để test orderIndex (không bị nhiễu từ test cũ)
####################################################################
# @name createOrderIndexCourse
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

{
  "title": "Test OrderIndex E2E",
  "slug": "test-order-index-e2e",
  "jlptLevel": "N5",
  "published": true
}

###
@courseId = {{createOrderIndexCourse.response.body.data.id}}

####################################################################
## CASE A) Auto max+1 khi tạo mà KHÔNG gửi orderIndex
## Mong đợi: L1=1, L2=2, L3=3
####################################################################
# @name autoA1
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/lessons
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

{ "title": "A.Lesson 1 (auto)" }

###
@lessonA1Id = {{autoA1.response.body.data.orderIndex}}
# → expect 1

###
# @name autoA2
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/lessons
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

{ "title": "A.Lesson 2 (auto)" }

###
@lessonA2Id = {{autoA2.response.body.data.orderIndex}}
# → expect 2

###
# @name autoA3
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/lessons
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

{ "title": "A.Lesson 3 (auto)" }

###
@lessonA3Id = {{autoA3.response.body.data.orderIndex}}
# → expect 3

### Verify: GET outline course xem thứ tự
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}
# → expect lessons[].orderIndex = [1, 2, 3]

####################################################################
## CASE B) Shift khi tạo mới với orderIndex = 1 (chen đầu)
## Trước: [A1=1, A2=2, A3=3]. Sau khi tạo "B" với orderIndex=1:
## Mong đợi: [B=1, A1=2, A2=3, A3=4]
####################################################################
# @name shiftB
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/lessons
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

{ "title": "B.Lesson chen đầu (orderIndex=1)", "orderIndex": 1 }

###
@lessonBId = {{shiftB.response.body.data.id}}
# → expect orderIndex=1

### Verify A1 đã bị shift lên 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonA1Id}}
# → expect orderIndex=2

GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonA2Id}}
# → expect orderIndex=3

GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonA3Id}}
# → expect orderIndex=4

####################################################################
## CASE C) Move-up: cập nhật orderIndex từ cuối lên đầu
## Trước: [B=1, A1=2, A2=3, A3=4]
## PUT A3 lên orderIndex=1
## Mong đợi: [A3=1, B=2, A1=3, A2=4]
####################################################################
PUT {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonA3Id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

{ "title": "A.Lesson 3 (đã lên đầu)", "orderIndex": 1 }

### Verify
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonBId}}
# → expect orderIndex=2

GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonA1Id}}
# → expect orderIndex=3

GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonA2Id}}
# → expect orderIndex=4

GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonA3Id}}
# → expect orderIndex=1

####################################################################
## CASE D) Move-down: cập nhật orderIndex từ đầu xuống cuối
## Trước: [A3=1, B=2, A1=3, A2=4]
## PUT A3 xuống orderIndex=4
## Mong đợi: [B=1, A1=2, A2=3, A3=4]
####################################################################
PUT {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonA3Id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

{ "title": "A.Lesson 3 (đã xuống cuối)", "orderIndex": 4 }

### Verify
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonBId}}
# → expect orderIndex=1

GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonA1Id}}
# → expect orderIndex=2

GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonA2Id}}
# → expect orderIndex=3

GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonA3Id}}
# → expect orderIndex=4

####################################################################
## CASE E) Clamp khi set orderIndex vượt MAX
## Trước: [B=1, A1=2, A2=3, A3=4] (max=4)
## PUT B với orderIndex=99
## Mong đợi: B bị clamp về 4 (MAX), các lesson khác giữ nguyên
## (Thực tế A3 đã ở 4 → B sẽ đẩy A3 xuống 5? Hay A3 sẽ bị shift?)
##   → Cần xem logic clampToMaxPlusOne: target=99, currentMax=4
##     → kẹp về 4, rồi planMove(2, 4) = MOVE_DOWN → shift (2, 4] lên -1
##     → B=4, A1=2, A2=3, A3=5? Không, planMove(2, 4) MOVE_DOWN:
##        dời các lesson trong (2, 4] lên -1 → A1=1, A2=2, A3=3, B=4
##        (Vì A1=2 đang ở vị trí cũ của B; shift các lesson ở giữa)
##   → Mong đợi: [A1=1, A2=2, A3=3, B=4]
####################################################################
PUT {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonBId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

{ "title": "B.Lesson (clamp về MAX)", "orderIndex": 99 }

### Verify
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonBId}}
# → expect orderIndex=4

GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonA1Id}}
# → expect orderIndex=1

GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonA2Id}}
# → expect orderIndex=2

GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonA3Id}}
# → expect orderIndex=3

####################################################################
## CASE F) Section orderIndex tự gán max+1
## Setup: tạo 1 lesson test riêng
####################################################################
# @name lessonForSectionOI
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/lessons
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

{ "title": "Lesson test section OI" }

###
@lessonSectionOIId = {{lessonForSectionOI.response.body.data.id}}

### Tạo section 1 (KANJI) — không gửi orderIndex
# @name sectionF1
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonSectionOIId}}/sections
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

{ "sectionType": "KANJI", "title": "F.Section 1 (auto)" }

###
@sectionF1Order = {{sectionF1.response.body.data.orderIndex}}
# → expect 1

### Tạo section 2 (VOCAB) — không gửi orderIndex
# @name sectionF2
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonSectionOIId}}/sections
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

{ "sectionType": "VOCABULARY", "title": "F.Section 2 (auto)" }

###
@sectionF2Order = {{sectionF2.response.body.data.orderIndex}}
# → expect 2

### Tạo section 3 (GRAMMAR) — không gửi orderIndex
# @name sectionF3
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonSectionOIId}}/sections
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

{ "sectionType": "GRAMMAR", "title": "F.Section 3 (auto)" }

###
@sectionF3Order = {{sectionF3.response.body.data.orderIndex}}
# → expect 3

### Tạo section 4 (TEST) — không gửi orderIndex
# @name sectionF4
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonSectionOIId}}/sections
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

{ "sectionType": "TEST", "title": "F.Section 4 (auto)" }

###
@sectionF4Order = {{sectionF4.response.body.data.orderIndex}}
# → expect 4

####################################################################
## CASE G) Kanji item orderIndex tự gán max+1
## Setup: lấy section KANJI ở case F
####################################################################
# @name itemG1
POST {{baseUrl}}/lesson-sections/{{sectionF1.response.body.data.id}}/kanji-items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

{ "characterId": 1, "note": "G.Kanji 1 (auto)" }

###
@itemG1Order = {{itemG1.response.body.data.orderIndex}}
# → expect 1

### @name itemG2
POST {{baseUrl}}/lesson-sections/{{sectionF1.response.body.data.id}}/kanji-items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

{ "characterId": 2, "note": "G.Kanji 2 (auto)" }

###
@itemG2Order = {{itemG2.response.body.data.orderIndex}}
# → expect 2

### Chen giữa: tạo với orderIndex=1 → G1 phải shift lên 2
# @name itemG3
POST {{baseUrl}}/lesson-sections/{{sectionF1.response.body.data.id}}/kanji-items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

{ "characterId": 3, "orderIndex": 1, "note": "G.Kanji 3 (chen đầu)" }

###
@itemG3Id = {{itemG3.response.body.data.id}}
@itemG3Order = {{itemG3.response.body.data.orderIndex}}
# → expect 1

### Verify G1 đã bị shift lên 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonSectionOIId}}
# → expect sectionF1.items[0].orderIndex=2 (G1), items[1].orderIndex=1 (G3), items[2].orderIndex=2 (G2)

####################################################################
## CLEANUP (optional) — xoá course test
####################################################################
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}
# Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
